            1367     2               !..Introduce stochastic parameter perturbations by creating as many scalar rand1, rand2, ...
            1368     2               !.. variables as needed to perturb different pieces of microphysics. gthompsn  21Mar2018
            1369     2               ! Setting spp_mp_opt to 1 gives graupel Y-intercept pertubations (2^0)
            1370     2               !                   2 gives cloud water distribution gamma shape parameter perturbations (2^1)
            1371     2               !                   4 gives CCN & IN activation perturbations (2^2)
            1372     2               !                   3 gives both 1+2
