            2963     3               !+---+---------------- BEGIN NEW ICE NUCLEATION -----------------------+
            2964     3               !> - Freezing of supercooled water (rain or cloud) is influenced by dust
            2965     3               !! but still using Bigg 1953 with a temperature adjustment of a few
            2966     3               !! degrees depending on dust concentration.  A default value by way
            2967     3               !! of idx_IN is 1.0 per Liter of air is used when dustyIce flag is
