            2969     3               !! using DeMott et al (2010) dust nucleation when water saturated or
            2970     3               !! Phillips et al (2008) when below water saturation; else, without
            2971     3               !! dustyIce flag, use the previous Cooper (1986) temperature-dependent
            2972     3               !! value.  Lastly, allow homogeneous freezing of deliquesced aerosols
