            3602     2   p    v               smoc(k) = a_ * smo2(k)**b_
            3603     2               
            3604     2               !>  - Calculate bm_s+bv_s (th) moment.  Useful for sedimentation.
            3605     2   p    v               loga_ = sa(1) + sa(2)*tc0 + sa(3)*cse(14) &
            3606     2                              + sa(4)*tc0*cse(14) + sa(5)*tc0*tc0 &
            3607     2                              + sa(6)*cse(14)*cse(14) + sa(7)*tc0*tc0*cse(14) &
            3608     2                              + sa(8)*tc0*cse(14)*cse(14) + sa(9)*tc0*tc0*tc0 &
