            3635                     !+---+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
            3636                     !> - Calculate y-intercept, slope values for rain.
            3637                     !+---+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
                                   <<<    Standard iteration count: 22
                                   <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
                                   <<<    SIMD(VL: 8)
